過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"原過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"原過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m041-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"原過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p041","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-110","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","surfaces":["原過"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p040","quote":"原過從，後，至於王澤，見三人，自帶以上可見，自帶以下不可見。與原過竹二節，莫通。曰：「爲我以是遺趙毋卹。」原過旣至，以告襄子。襄子齊三日，親自剖竹，有朱書曰：「趙毋卹，余霍泰山山陽侯天使也。三月丙戌，余將使女反滅知氏。女亦立我百邑，余將賜女林胡之地。至于後世，且有伉王，赤黑，龍面而鳥噣，鬢麋髭髯，大膺大胸，修下而馮，左袵界乘，奄有河宗，至于休溷諸貉，南伐晉別，北滅黑姑。」襄子再拜，受三神之令。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p041","quote":"三國攻晉陽，歳餘，引汾水灌其城，城不浸者三版。城中懸釜而炊，易子而食。群臣皆有外心，禮益慢，唯髙共不敢失禮。襄子懼，乃夜使相張孟同私於韓、魏。韓、魏與合謀，以三月丙戌，三國反滅知氏，共分其地。於是襄子行賞，髙共爲上。張孟同曰：「晉陽之難，唯共無功。」襄子曰：「方晉陽急，群臣皆懈，惟共不敢失人臣禮，是以先之。」於是趙北有代，南并知氏，彊於韓、魏。遂祠三神於百邑，使原過主霍泰山祠祀。"}],"rationale":"限本篇連續敘事、是為、諡稱及明示親屬語境。周舍／周捨按諫臣同段暫接；兩位周、中山武公與趙武公、子朝與趙朝分開。圍鄭晉陽知伯與較早知伯文子仍分候選，不因同爵或熟知姓名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p040","text":"原過從，後，至於王澤，見三人，自帶以上可見，自帶以下不可見。與原過竹二節，莫通。曰：「爲我以是遺趙毋卹。」原過旣至，以告襄子。襄子齊三日，親自剖竹，有朱書曰：「趙毋卹，余霍泰山山陽侯天使也。三月丙戌，余將使女反滅知氏。女亦立我百邑，余將賜女林胡之地。至于後世，且有伉王，赤黑，龍面而鳥噣，鬢麋髭髯，大膺大胸，修下而馮，左袵界乘，奄有河宗，至于休溷諸貉，南伐晉別，北滅黑姑。」襄子再拜，受三神之令。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"原過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"原過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0048","start":48,"end":51,"surface":"趙毋卹","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"原過","kind":"person","person_id":"onm_kp8_q59","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"趙毋卹","kind":"person","person_id":"0xt_iyn_d3t_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0085","start":85,"end":93,"surface":"霍泰山山陽侯天使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"知氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"伉王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m040-0187","start":187,"end":189,"surface":"襄子","kind